# The issue drafts are not part of this repository: they are the bodies of
# tickets that live in the Vaadin repositories, and the links to them go in the
# root README when they are opened. They stay here on disk while they are being
# posted, and out of git either way.
*.md

# The reproducer projects ship as zips under projects/, because a reader who
# opens an issue wants one file to download. An unzipped working copy is scratch
# and must not come back into the repository.
*/
!projects/
projects/*
!projects/*.zip

# A screenshot a reply links to has to be reachable from the repository, because
# the API cannot attach a file to an issue or a comment.
!projects/*.png
